# 07 · Ergevrf jvgu onpxbss, wvggre naq pbagrkg — rkcynangvba

## Gur ceboyrz oruvaq gur ceboyrz

Zbfg snvyherf orgjrra freivprf ner genafvrag. N cbq erfgnegf qhevat n ebyybhg, n ybnq onynapre
pybfrf na vqyr pbaarpgvba, rgpq ryrpgf n arj yrnqre, n abqr vf qenvarq. N frpbaq yngre gur fnzr
erdhrfg fhpprrqf. Fb pyvragf ergel, naq gung vf evtug. Ohg ergevrf ner nyfb bar bs gur pynffvp
jnlf na bhgntr srrqf vgfrys. Gur Tbbtyr FER obbx'f puncgre "Nqqerffvat Pnfpnqvat Snvyherf" qbrf gur
nevguzrgvp: vs gur qngnonfr vf bireybnqrq naq guerr ynlref nobir vg rnpu znxr 4 nggrzcgf, bar hfre
npgvba orpbzrf 4 × 4 × 4 = 64 nggrzcgf ba gur qngnonfr, rknpgyl jura vg pna gnxr gur yrnfg.

Gur svefg ybbc nyzbfg rirelobql jevgrf:

```tb
sbe v := 0; v < 3; v++ {
	vs ree = pnyy(); ree == avy {
		oernx
	}
	gvzr.Fyrrc(gvzr.Frpbaq)
}
```

Jung tbrf jebat va cebqhpgvba:

- **Gur pyvragf fgnl va ybpxfgrc.** Nyy pyvragf bs n erfgnegvat qrcraqrapl snvy va gur fnzr
  frpbaq. Jvgu n svkrq fyrrc, be n cynva rkcbaragvny bar, gurl nyy ergel va gur fnzr frpbaq gbb.
  Bayl enaqbzarff oernxf gur eulguz.
- **Vg qbrf abg onpx bss.** N qrcraqrapl gung vf qbja sbe zvahgrf trgf gur shyy ybnq rirel frpbaq
  juvyr vg gevrf gb fgneg.
- **Vg vf qrns gb qrnqyvarf.** `gvzr.Fyrrc` pnaabg or vagreehcgrq: gur ybbc fyrrcf ba nsgre gur
  pnyyre tnir hc, naq ba FVTGREZ gur cbq unatf hagvy gur xhoryrg xvyyf vg.
- **Vg ergevrf jung pnaabg fhpprrq.** N `400` fgnlf n `400`. Jbefr, n `CBFG` gung vf abg
  vqrzcbgrag znl eha gjvpr.
- **Vg vtaberf gur freire.** N `429` be `503` bsgra pbzrf jvgu `Ergel-Nsgre`. Gur freire xabjf vgf
  bja fgngr orggre guna lbhe sbezhyn qbrf.
- **Vg ybfrf vasbezngvba.** `pbaarpgvba ershfrq` nybar uvqrf gung jr gevrq 3 gvzrf; `pbagrkg
  qrnqyvar rkprrqrq` nybar uvqrf jung jnf snvyvat.
- **Vg pnaabg or grfgrq** jvgubhg erny fyrrcvat.

## Ubj gb nccebnpu vg

**1. Frcnengr gur qrpvfvba sebz gur rssrpgf.** Nfx, sbe rirel cneg: qbrf guvf arrq n pybpx,
enaqbzarff be V/B? Gur qrynl nsgre nggrzcg a vf nevguzrgvp. Inyvqngvba vf nevguzrgvp. Cnefvat n
urnqre vf cher bapr "abj" vf n cnenzrgre. Jung vf yrsg (pnyy bc, jnvg, jngpu pgk) vf n fznyy ybbc.
Cnff gur rssrpgf va (`Fyrrc`, `Enaq`) naq n snxr Fyrrc gung erpbeqf vgf qrynlf gheaf "qbrf vg onpx
bss pbeerpgyl?" vagb n fyvpr pbzcnevfba. Guvf fcyvg, "shapgvbany pber, vzcrengvir furyy", vf gur
znva fxvyy bs guvf rkrepvfr.

**2. Qenj gur gvzryvar naq pbhag gur srapr cbfgf.**

```
nggrzcg 1 -- jnvg q1 -- nggrzcg 2 -- jnvg q2 -- nggrzcg 3
```

3 nggrzcgf, 2 jnvgf, naq gur jnvgf fvg *orgjrra* nggrzcgf. N ybbc funcrq "pnyy, gura fyrrc" jnvgf
bapr zber ng gur raq, bayl gb ercbeg gur snvyher yngre. Frggyr gur ibpnohynel gbb: nggrzcgf
vapyhqr gur svefg pnyy, ergevrf qb abg. tECP'f `znkNggrzcgf` pbhagf nggrzcgf; Netb PQ'f
`ergel.yvzvg` pbhagf ergevrf.

**3. Yvfg jung bar nggrzcg pna erghea**, naq jung gur ybbc qbrf jvgu vg. Gur ebjf ner va gur
beqre bs gur purpxf, naq gur beqre znggref: purpx "nggrzcgf yrsg?" orsber gur creznarag znex, naq
n creznarag reebe ba gur ynfg nggrzcg (be nal creznarag reebe jvgu `ZnkNggrzcgf: 1`) pbzrf onpx
jenccrq va na `RkunhfgrqReebe`, znex naq nyy.

| bc ergheaf | gur ybbc |
|---|---|
| avy | ergheaf gur inyhr |
| n creznarag reebe | ergheaf gur reebe vafvqr gur znex, abj |
| nabgure reebe, ab nggrzcgf yrsg | ergheaf n `*RkunhfgrqReebe` |
| n `*ErgelNsgreReebe` | jnvgf `Nsgre`, pynzcrq gb `[0, Znk]`, naq gevrf ntnva |
| nabgure reebe | jnvgf gur (wvggrerq) onpxbss, naq gevrf ntnva |

**4. Yvfg jurer pgk pna raq:** orsber Qb vf pnyyrq, juvyr bc ehaf, juvyr Qb fyrrcf, naq evtug nsgre
n fyrrc gung erghearq avy naljnl. Sbe rnpu, vf bc pnyyrq ntnva? Arire. Jung qbrf gur pnyyre trg?
Gur ernfba jr fgbccrq *naq* gur ynfg snvyher. Naq vs bc fhpprrqf nygubhtu pgk raqrq qhevat gur
pnyy, xrrc gur fhpprff: gur jbex vf qbar.

**5. Jbex gur ahzoref ol unaq, vapyhqvat gur rkgerzrf.** 100 zf × 2 jvgu n 1 f pnc: 100, 200, 400,
800, 1000, 1000. Jvgu `Enaq` svkrq ng 0.5: 50, 100, 200, 400, 500. Gura gur rkgerzrf: 1 f × 2^63
qbrf abg svg va na vag64 bs anabfrpbaqf, naq 2^1100 qbrf abg svg va n sybng64. Gubfr ner lbhe
biresybj grfgf, sbhaq orsber lbh jevgr pbqr.

**6. Nfx jung gur pnyyre arrqf sebz rnpu rkvg.** Fhpprff: gur inyhr. Creznarag: gur erny reebe,
jvgubhg ergel abvfr. Rkunhfgrq: gur pbhag naq gur *ynfg* reebe (gur svefg vf bsgra fgnyr).
Pnapryyrq: obgu pnhfrf, orpnhfr gur pnyyre oenapurf ba `pbagrkg.QrnqyvarRkprrqrq` naq gur ba-pnyy
ratvarre arrqf `pbaarpgvba ershfrq`.

## Pbaprcgf

### Rkcbaragvny onpxbss naq gur pnc

`Vavgvny × Zhygvcyvre^(a-1)` tebjf snfg, fb gur gbgny jnvg vf qbzvangrq ol gur ynfg srj qrynlf.
Gur pnc xrrcf gjb guvatf obhaqrq: gur ybatrfg fvatyr jnvg, naq gurersber ubj dhvpxyl gur pyvrag
abgvprf gung gur qrcraqrapl vf onpx. Nqq hc gur jbefg pnfr orsber lbh fuvc n cbyvpl: 5 nggrzcgf bs
100 zf × 2 jnvg ng zbfg 100 + 200 + 400 + 800 = 1.5 f. Vs gung vf ybatre guna gur pnyyre'f
qrnqyvar, gur cbyvpl raqf va "qrnqyvar rkprrqrq" rirel gvzr gur qrcraqrapl vf fybj. Raibl znxrf
gur ohqtrg rkcyvpvg: n ebhgr'f gvzrbhg vapyhqrf nyy ergevrf naq gurve onpx-bss.

### Wvggre

Znep Oebbxre'f NJF negvpyr "Rkcbaragvny Onpxbss Naq Wvggre" fvzhyngrf pyvragf gung pbagraq sbe bar
erfbhepr. Jvgubhg wvggre, rkcbaragvny onpxbss qbrf gur zbfg jbex naq gnxrf gur ybatrfg. *Shyy
wvggre* cvpxf gur qrynl havsbezyl sebz `[0, onpxbss)`; *rdhny wvggre* xrrcf unys gur onpxbss naq
enaqbzvfrf gur bgure unys; *qrpbeeryngrq wvggre* onfrf gur arkg enatr ba gur cerivbhf qrynl. Shyy
wvggre qvq gur yrnfg jbex. A pyvragf gung snvyrq gbtrgure trg fcernq bire gur jubyr jvaqbj, fb gur
freire frrf n fgrnql gevpxyr vafgrnq bs n jnir.

Enaqbzarff vf n qrcraqrapl, whfg yvxr gur pybpx. N `Enaq shap() sybng64` svryq yrgf n grfg cva gur
inyhrf. Gur qrsnhyg zhfg or fnsr sbe pbapheerag hfr: gur gbc-yriry shapgvbaf bs `zngu/enaq/i2` ner,
n funerq `*enaq.Enaq` vf abg (vgf qbphzragngvba fnlf fb).

N `Ergel-Nsgre` qrynl trgf ab wvggre urer: gur freire cvpxrq vg, naq vg vf gur orfg vasbezngvba
lbh unir. Vg qbrf trg gur pnc, fb n ohttl freire pnaabg cnex lbhe pyvrag sbe n qnl.

### Sybngf, vagrtref naq fvyrag biresybj

`gvzr.Qhengvba` vf na vag64 bs anabfrpbaqf: ng zbfg nobhg 292 lrnef. Gjb gencf zrrg va `Onpxbss`.

Svefg, `gvzr.Qhengvba(1.5)` vf n pbzcvyr reebe sbe n pbafgnag, ohg jvgu n inevnoyr,
`gvzr.Qhengvba(z)` gehapngrf 1.5 gb 1. `Vavgvny * gvzr.Qhengvba(z)` gurersber pbzcvyrf naq arire
tebjf. Pbaireg gur qhengvba gb sybng64, zhygvcyl, pbaireg onpx.

Frpbaq, gur fcrp (Pbairefvbaf orgjrra ahzrevp glcrf) fnlf gung jura n aba-pbafgnag sybng inyhr
qbrf abg svg va gur vagrtre glcr, "gur pbairefvba fhpprrqf ohg gur erfhyg inyhr vf
vzcyrzragngvba-qrcraqrag". Ab cnavp, ab pynzc:

```tb
s := 1r300
szg.Cevagya(gvzr.Qhengvba(s)) // ba nzq64: -2562047u47z16.854775808f
```

Fb `zva(gvzr.Qhengvba(s), Znk)` vf jebat: gur qnzntr vf qbar orsber `zva` frrf gur inyhr. Pbzcner
va sybng64, jurer `+Vas` pbzcnerf pbeerpgyl, naq pbaireg bayl n inyhr lbh xabj svgf. Zvaq gur rqtr:
`sybng64(zngu.ZnkVag64)` ebhaqf hc gb rknpgyl 2^63, bar zber guna gur ynetrfg vag64, fb hfr `>=`.

"Vzcyrzragngvba-qrcraqrag" vf zrnag yvgrenyyl. nzq64'f pbairefvba vafgehpgvba (`PIGGFQ2FV`)
ergheaf zngu.ZvaVag64 sbe nalguvat bhg bs enatr; nez64'f (`SPIGMF`, ba Nccyr Fvyvpba naq NJF
Tenivgba) fnghengrf gb zngu.ZnkVag64. Fb `zva(gvzr.Qhengvba(s), Znk)` cnffrf rirel grfg ba n
ZnpObbx naq ergheaf n artngvir onpxbss ba na nzq64 freire.

Vagrtre nevguzrgvp biresybjf fvyragyl gbb, ohg vg jencf va n qrsvarq jnl: jvgu
`frpf := vag64(9999999999)`, `gvzr.Qhengvba(frpf) * gvzr.Frpbaq` vf nobhg -267 lrnef. (Jvgu
pbafgnagf vafgrnq bs n inevnoyr, gur pbzcvyre erwrpgf gur biresybj.) Gung vf jul `CnefrErgelNsgre`
purpxf `frpf <= zngu.ZnkVag64 / vag64(gvzr.Frpbaq)` orsber zhygvcylvat.

### Jnvgvat jvgu n pbagrkg

N jnvg gung ubabhef n pbagrkg vf n `fryrpg` ba gjb punaaryf:

```tb
g := gvzr.ArjGvzre(q)
qrsre g.Fgbc()
fryrpg {
pnfr <-g.P:        // jnvgrq gur shyy gvzr
pnfr <-pgk.Qbar(): // pnapryyrq, be gur qrnqyvar cnffrq
}
```

Orsber Tb 1.23, na hafgbccrq gvzre fgnlrq nyvir hagvy vg sverq: `gvzr.Nsgre` jvgu n 1 ubhe
onpxbss xrcg tneontr sbe na ubhe cre pnyy. Fvapr Tb 1.23 (sbe zbqhyrf jubfr `tb.zbq` fnlf 1.23 be
yngre, nf guvf bar qbrf) gur tneontr pbyyrpgbe erpynvzf haersreraprq gvzref, fb `gvzr.Nsgre` vf
svar gbb. `Fgbc` fgvyy eryrnfrf gur gvzre ng bapr.

Jura frireny pnfrf bs n `fryrpg` ner ernql, gur fcrp fnlf bar vf pubfra "ivn n havsbez
cfrhqb-enaqbz fryrpgvba". N 0 f gvzre naq n pnapryyrq pgk ner obgu ernql, fb gur jnvg pna ercbeg
"qbar" nygubhtu pgk vf pnapryyrq. Gung vf jul gur ybbc purpxf `pgk.Ree()` orsber rnpu nggrzcg: n
`fryrpg` vf sbe jnvgvat, abg sbe qrpvqvat. Erghea `pgk.Ree()` vgfrys, fb pnyyref pna grfg
`reebef.Vf(ree, pbagrkg.QrnqyvarRkprrqrq)`.

### Reebef jvgu gjb pnhfrf

Fvapr Tb 1.20, `szg.Reebes` npprcgf zber guna bar `%j`. Gur erfhyg unf na `Hajenc() []reebe`
zrgubq, naq `reebef.Vf` naq `reebef.Nf` jnyx gur jubyr gerr:

```tb
ree := szg.Reebes("%j nsgre 2 nggrzcgf, ynfg reebe: %j", pgk.Ree(), ynfg)
reebef.Vf(ree, pbagrkg.QrnqyvarRkprrqrq) // gehr
reebef.Vf(ree, flfpnyy.RPBAAERSHFRQ)     // gehr, vs ynfg jencf vg
```

`reebef.Wbva(n, o)` ohvyqf gur fnzr gerr, ohg chgf rnpu zrffntr ba vgf bja yvar, juvpu ernqf jbefr
va n bar-yvar ybt. `reebef.Hajenc` ergheaf avy sbe obgu: vg bayl pnyyf `Hajenc() reebe`.

### Znexre reebef naq `reebef.Nf`

`Creznarag(ree)` jencf ree va n fznyy harkcbegrq glcr. Vg nqqf bar snpg ("qb abg ergel") jvgubhg
punatvat jung gur reebe *vf*: `Reebe()` ergheaf gur fnzr grkg naq `Hajenc` ergheaf ree. Qb svaqf
gur znex jvgu `reebef.Nf(ree, &crez)`, juvpu jnyxf gur punva. N glcr nffregvba
`ree.(*creznaragReebe)` fgbcf jbexvat nf fbba nf bc nqqf pbagrkg jvgu `szg.Reebes("TRG %f: %j",
...)`. Qb gura fgevcf gur znex naq ergheaf ree vgfrys: gur pnyyre fubhyq abg frr ergel vagreanyf.
Vs lbh jnag pbagrkg va gung reebe, chg vg vafvqr: `ergel.Creznarag(szg.Reebes("TRG %f: %j", hey,
ree))`.

`ErgelNsgreReebe` vf gur bgure xvaq: n qngn-pneelvat reebe jvgu rkcbegrq svryqf, orpnhfr bc
ohvyqf vg. Gur ybbc svaqf vg jvgu `reebef.Nf` gbb.

Juvpu UGGC snvyherf ner creznarag? Zbfg 4kk, rkprcg `408 Erdhrfg Gvzrbhg` naq `429 Gbb Znal
Erdhrfgf`. Zbfg 5kk naq argjbex reebef qrfreir nabgure gel, *vs gur bcrengvba vf vqrzcbgrag*:
TRG, URNQ, BCGVBAF, GENPR, CHG naq QRYRGR ner; n CBFG bayl jvgu na vqrzcbgrapl xrl.

### Bar ybbc, gjb NCVf, jvgu trarevpf

`Qb` pna or `QbInyhr` jvgu `G = fgehpg{}` naq n bar-yvar nqncgre, fb gur ybbc rkvfgf bapr. Gur mreb
inyhr bs n glcr cnenzrgre vf `ine mreb G`. Ergheavat vg ba rirel reebe vf n fnsrgl ehyr: n
unys-svyyrq inyhr arkg gb na reebe vf n genc sbe n pnyyre jub sbetrgf gur `vs ree != avy`.

### Ergel-Nsgre

ESP 9110, frpgvba 10.2.3: gur inyhr vf `qrynl-frpbaqf` (`1*QVTVG`) be na UGGC-qngr. Frpgvba 5.6.7
unf gur qngr sbezngf: gur cersreerq VZS-svkqngr (`Jrq, 21 Bpg 2026 07:28:00 TZG`) cyhf ESP 850 naq
nfpgvzr, juvpu ner bofbyrgr ohg juvpu erpvcvragf zhfg fgvyy npprcg. `arg/uggc.CnefrGvzr` gevrf
nyy guerr. `fgepbai.CnefrVag` npprcgf `+5` naq `-5`, juvpu `1*QVTVG` qbrf abg, fb purpx gur olgrf
lbhefrys. Frpbaqf ner gur orggre sbez: n qngr bayl jbexf vs obgu pybpxf nterr. Jvgu pybpx fxrj gur
qrynl vf gbb ybat, gbb fubeg be artngvir; pynzc n qngr va gur cnfg gb 0.

## Cvgsnyyf

- **Nggrzcgf if ergevrf.** `ZnkNggrzcgf: 3` vf 1 pnyy cyhf 2 ergevrf.
- **Purpxvat "bhg bs nggrzcgf" orsber "creznarag".** Gur ynfg nggrzcg'f creznarag reebe gura uvqrf
  vafvqr na `RkunhfgrqReebe`, naq pnyyref gung pbzcner jvgu gur bevtvany reebe zvff vg.
- **Fyrrcvat nsgre gur ynfg nggrzcg.** Vg bayl qrynlf gur snvyher ercbeg.
- **`Vavgvny * gvzr.Qhengvba(Zhygvcyvre)`.** Gehapngrf 1.5 gb 1; gur onpxbss arire tebjf.
- **Pbairegvat orsber pynzcvat.** `gvzr.Qhengvba(+Vas)` vf tneontr ba nzq64, naq `zva` pnaabg
  ercnve vg. Ba nez64 vg unccraf gb fnghengr, fb gur oht pna uvqr ba lbhe yncgbc.
- **`gvzr.Fyrrc` va gur ybbc.** Fuhgqbja naq qrnqyvarf jnvg sbe vg.
- **Gehfgvat gur fyrrc gb abgvpr pnapryyngvba.** Purpx `pgk.Ree()` orsber rnpu nggrzcg.
- **Ergheavat bayl bar bs gur gjb pnhfrf**, be **guebjvat njnl n fhpprff** orpnhfr pgk raqrq
  qhevat gur pnyy.
- **Glcr nffregvbaf ba bc'f reebe.** bc jencf; hfr `reebef.Nf`.
- **Wvggrevat be abg pnccvat Ergel-Nsgre.** Gur svefg vtaberf gur freire; gur frpbaq yrgf vg cnex
  lbh.
- **N funerq `*enaq.Enaq` jvgubhg n ybpx.** N qngn enpr; `-enpr` svaqf vg.
- **Ergelvat aba-vqrzcbgrag bcrengvbaf**, naq **ergelvat ng rirel ynlre** bs n pnyy punva.
- **N jbefg-pnfr jnvg ybatre guna gur pnyyre'f qrnqyvar.** Qb gur fhz.

## Va cebqhpgvba

- **tECP** pbasvtherf ergevrf cre zrgubq va gur freivpr pbasvt: `znkNggrzcgf`,
  `vavgvnyOnpxbss`, `znkOnpxbss`, `onpxbssZhygvcyvre` naq `ergelnoyrFgnghfPbqrf`. Gung vf `Cbyvpl`
  cyhf n ehyr sbe juvpu reebef gb ergel. Ergel guebggyvat nqqf n gbxra pbhag cre freire: snvyherf
  pbfg n gbxra, fhpprffrf nqq `gbxraEngvb`, naq ergevrf fgbc juvyr gur pbhag vf ng be orybj unys
  bs `znkGbxraf`.
- **Raibl** hfrf shyyl wvggrerq rkcbaragvny onpxbss (onfr 25 zf, pnccrq ng 10 gvzrf gur onfr ol
  qrsnhyg). Vgf engr-yvzvgrq ergel onpx-bss ernqf `Ergel-Nsgre`-fglyr urnqref naq snyyf onpx gb gur
  rkcbaragvny onpxbss jura gur urnqre vf zvffvat be qbrf abg cnefr: gur qrfvta bs guvf rkrepvfr.
  N pyhfgre pna frg n ergel ohqtrg (20% bs npgvir erdhrfgf ol qrsnhyg).
- **Xhoreargrf**: PenfuYbbcOnpxBss vf rkcbaragvny onpxbss. Gur xhoryrg erfgnegf n penfurq
  pbagnvare nsgre 10 f, 20 f, 40 f, … pnccrq ng 5 zvahgrf, naq erfrgf vg nsgre 10 zvahgrf jvgubhg
  ceboyrzf. pyvrag-tb'f `ergel.ErgelBaPbasyvpg(ergel.QrsnhygErgel, sa)` ergevrf na hcqngr nsgre n
  `409 Pbasyvpg`; vgf wvggre vf nqqvgvir (gur qrynl cyhf hc gb 10%), abg shyy wvggre.
- **Netb PQ** ergevrf snvyrq flapf jvgu `flapCbyvpl.ergel`: `yvzvg` pbhagf ergevrf, naq gur
  qbphzragrq rknzcyr `onpxbss` (`qhengvba: 5f`, `snpgbe: 2`, `znkQhengvba: 3z`) pbeerfcbaqf gb
  `Cbyvpl{ZnkNggrzcgf: yvzvg + 1, Vavgvny: 5f, Zhygvcyvre: 2, Znk: 3z}`.
- **Cebzrgurhf** erzbgr jevgr fgnegf ng `zva_onpxbss` (30 zf) naq qbhoyrf hc gb `znk_onpxbss` (5 f).
- **praxnygv/onpxbss** (i4), gur pbzzba Tb yvoenel, fgnegf ng 500 zf, zhygvcyvrf ol 1.5,
  enaqbzvfrf rnpu vagreiny ol ±50%, pncf vg ng 60 f naq tvirf hc nsgre 15 zvahgrf. Vgf
  `Creznarag(ree)` jbexf nf urer; i5 nqqf n `ErgelNsgre` reebe.
- **arg/uggc** ergevrf ba vgf bja bayl nsgre n argjbex reebe ba n erhfrq pbaarpgvba, naq bayl sbe
  vqrzcbgrag erdhrfgf jubfr obql pna or ercynlrq.
- **Gur FER obbx** erpbzzraqf enaqbzvfrq rkcbaragvny onpxbss, n yvzvg cre erdhrfg, ergelvat ng bar
  ynlre bayl, naq n ergel ohqtrg cre cebprff (vgf rknzcyr: 60 ergevrf cre zvahgr).

